 vim.api.nvim_buf_set_lines(bufnr, row, row + 1, false, { \"[Suggestion ID: \" .. id .. \" Rejected]\" })\n            else\n                print(\"Pear: No suggestion found on this line.\")\n            end\n        end,\n        noremap = true,\n        silent = true,\n        desc = \"Reject Pear Suggestion\",\n    })\nend\n```\n\nInstruction: explain this function\n\nIMPORTANT: You MUST use the `edit` tool to apply any code changes or comments. Do not just output the code blocks in chat. Use the edit tool with the exact file path `/home/mase/github/pear/lua/pear/ui.lua`.","type":"text"}]},"type":"message_end"}
